    <updated>2024-10-23T03:42:25Z</updated>

    <summary>こんにちは！ 今日は月に1度の出張美容室の日です( ´ ▽ ` ) 毎月後半の水...</summary>
    <author>
        <name>あやめ池</name>
        
    </author>
    
        <category term="ご入居者日記" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
